# 2026-08-20: the SAME gap as the 2026-08-19 MSG_*/Acosta_* finding, one class wider. Two new
# artifact families landed at repo root and NEITHER matched an existing prefix rule:
#   - Amlong_Appointment_Brief_*.pdf  — a homeowner brief: both owners' names, mobile numbers,
#     personal + firm email, ~$600k equity position, and their pending litigation.
#   - Rozo_Deutsche_Satisfaction_*.pdf — a private individual's recorded foreclosure instrument,
#     pulled from the county recorder, carrying her name, unit address and case history.
# refresh-dealflow.bat / run-leads.bat stage broadly, so each was one bat-run from a PUBLIC repo.
# Prefix-by-prefix has now failed twice. Switch to blocking BY KIND: `git ls-files "*.pdf"` returns
# ZERO — no PDF has ever belonged in this repo, so a blanket rule costs nothing and cannot be
# out-run by the next new filename. The one publishable artifact (the REDACTED balloon book) is
# HTML under docs/hm-balloon-q7v3n8/ and is untouched by this.
*.pdf
*_Appointment_Brief_*.html
*_Position_Report_*.html
